DESCRIPTION:Friends of Maroochy Botanic Gardens proudly presents “Here\, 
 inspired by Nature” Featuring the work of 12 artists - Here\, inspired b
 y Nature explores the connection between people\, nature and art across di
 verse media and generations. The exhibition celebrates the 20th anniversar
 y of the Sculpture Garden and the Friends’ continuing support of creativ
 ity. Artists: Judy Barrass\, Peta Boyce\, Finn Cossar\, Lyn Gooch\, Chris 
 Jefferson\, Indie Healy\, Kim Herringe\, Ella Herwald\, Ester Horton\, Ame
 lia Hughes\, Meg Kelso\, Lesley Kendall & Sladana Savic. 12-27 September 2
 026 Admission Free Open 7 days from 9.30 am to 2.30 pm* *except Sunday 27t
 h September when the exhibition will close at 12 Noon.
